    "title": "WORLD PREMIERE: Tate McRae - 'Housewife' - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Michael Cerio ,\n27 minutes ago RCA Records / Audacy After some playful teasing, the next chapter from Tate McRae is here, as the singer has debuted her new single, \"Housewife.\"\nFind your favorite station on the free Audacy app\nYou can hear the WORLD PREMIERE of \"Housewife\" from Tate McRae all weekend long right here.\nFirst teased during her Lollapalooza and Osheaga sets earlier this year, \"Housewife\" likely serves as the lead single from McRae's upcoming forth studio album, her first since 2025's So Close To What .\nTate has described the track as a playful song about \"a woman who can't be contained,\" filming the visuals for the track in the south of France.\nDon't miss the WORLD PREMIERE of \"Housewife\" from Tate McRae all weekend long right here.",
